sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Kafka as Kafka orders topic
    participant Worker as Inventory consumer
    participant Store as Persistence inventory transaction
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Kafka-->>Worker: OrderCreated record
    Worker->>Worker: Parse envelope and validate event type/version
    alt Malformed, unsupported, or unrelated record
        Worker->>Worker: Log skipped record with topic, partition, offset
        Worker->>Kafka: Commit offset so the group can continue
    else Valid OrderCreated
        Worker->>Store: process_order_created(event)
        Store->>DB: Begin transaction, insert processed_events marker
        alt Marker already exists
            DB-->>Store: Conflict, no new marker
            Store->>DB: Commit no-op transaction
            Store-->>Worker: Duplicate
            Worker->>Kafka: Commit offset
        else New marker
            Store->>DB: Lock order
            Store->>Store: Verify event customer against order
            alt Order is missing or customer does not match
                Store-->>Worker: InvalidEvent, transaction rolls back
                Worker->>Worker: Log invalid event
                Worker->>Kafka: Commit skipped offset
            else Customer matches
                alt Order is no longer pending
                    Store->>DB: Commit processed marker without stock changes
                    Store-->>Worker: IgnoredNoLongerPending
                    Worker->>Kafka: Commit offset
                else Order is pending
                    Store->>DB: Read persisted order items
                    Store->>Store: Compare event lines against order items
                    alt Event items do not match persisted order
                        Store-->>Worker: InvalidEvent, transaction rolls back
                        Worker->>Worker: Log invalid event
                        Worker->>Kafka: Commit skipped offset
                    else Event items match
                        Store->>DB: Lock product rows in stable ID order
                        alt Enough stock for every line
                            Store->>DB: Decrement stock and insert reservations
                            Store->>DB: Set order status to accepted
                            Store->>DB: Enqueue OrderAccepted in outbox
                            Store->>DB: Commit marker, stock, status, reservations, and event
                            DB-->>Store: Commit succeeded
                            Store-->>Worker: Accepted
                            Worker->>Kafka: Commit offset after DB commit
                        else One or more lines short on stock
                            Store->>DB: Leave stock unchanged and set order status to rejected
                            Store->>DB: Enqueue OrderRejected with reason
                            Store->>DB: Commit marker, status, and event
                            DB-->>Store: Commit succeeded
                            Store-->>Worker: Rejected(reason)
                            Worker->>Kafka: Commit offset after DB commit
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end
